      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in that day thou shalt say, O LORD, I will praise thee: though thou wast angry with me, thy anger is turned away, and thou hast comforted me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.12.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.12.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my salvation; I will trust, and not be afraid: for the LORD JEHOVAH ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my strength and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " song; he also is become my salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.12.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.12.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore with joy shall ye draw water out of the wells of salvation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.12.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.12.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in that day shall ye say, Praise the LORD, call upon his name, declare his doings among the people, make mention that his name is exalted.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.12.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.12.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to the LORD; for he hath done excellent things: this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " known in all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ISA.12.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:ISA.12.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cry aloud and shout, thou inhabitant of Zion: for great ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Holy One of Israel in the midst of thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
